# Perplexity Browser Session → Local OpenAI-compatible API (Setup Guide)

Ye setup aapke Perplexity account ke **browser session** ko ek local API server mein convert karta hai,
taaki aapko **official Perplexity API key kharidne ki zaroorat na pade**.

Support: `perplexity-webui-scraper==1.2.1` | Python 3.14 | Windows  
Project: `D:\GNW\perplexity-browser-api`

---

## Step 1 — Environment ready ho gaya (verify)

Neender package install ho chuka hai. Confirm karne ke liye:

```powershell
cd D:\GNW\perplexity-browser-api
uv run perplexity-webui-scraper --help
```

Aapko teen commands dikheni chahiye: `token`, `api`, `mcp`.

---

## Step 2 — Apna Perplexity session token nikaalein (Browser se)

Yeh sabse important step hai. Token bina aapka server authenticate nahi kar payega.

1. Browser kholein (Chrome/Edge) aur [perplexity.ai](https://www.perplexity.ai) par login karein.
2. `F12` dabayein → **Application** tab → **Cookies** → `www.perplexity.ai`.
3. Cookie `__Secure-next-auth.session-token` dhoondhein aur uski value copy karein.
   - Agar ye cookie nahi dikh rahi, toh ek baar page refresh karein aur login state confirm karein.
4. Is value ko `.env` mein paste karein (step 3 dekhein).

> **Free account:** sirf text prompts chalenge. Pro/Max model aur file upload ke liye paid subscription chahiye.  
> **Risk:** Yeh unofficial reverse-engineered endpoint hai. Perplexity kabhi bhi API badal sakta hai, cookie revoke kar sakta hai, ya account suspend kar sakta hai. Personal use ke liye OK; production ke liye official API use karein.

---

## Step 3 — `.env` banayein

```powershell
cd D:\GNW\perplexity-browser-api
copy .env.example .env
```

Ab `.env` kholein aur yeein bharein:
- `PERPLEXITY_SESSION_TOKEN` = step 2 se copy kiya hua token (bina quotes ke bhi chalega).
- `PERPLEXITY_API_KEY` = koi bhi random string (server par protection ke liye, optional).
- `PPLX_API_PORT` = default `8000`.

---

## Step 4 — API server chalayein

```powershell
cd D:\GNW\perplexity-browser-api
uv run perplexity-webui-scraper api --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
```

Agar `.env` mein `PERPLEXITY_SESSION_TOKEN` set hai, toh server apne default token se chalega.  
Agar nahi set, toh har request mein `Authorization: Bearer <SESSION_TOKEN>` bhejna hoga.

Server URL: **http://127.0.0.1:8000**  
Swagger UI: **http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs**

Server ko band karne ke liye: `Ctrl+C`.

---

## Step 5 — API test karein (curl ya Python)

### A) curl se (non-streaming)

```powershell
$env:PERPLEXITY_SESSION_TOKEN = "PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE"

curl http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions `
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $env:PERPLEXITY_SESSION_TOKEN" `
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" `
  -d '{"model":"perplexity/best","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"What is quantum computing?"}],"stream":false}'
```

### B) curl se (streaming)

```powershell
curl -N http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions `
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $env:PERPLEXITY_SESSION_TOKEN" `
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" `
  -d '{"model":"perplexity/best","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Explain AI in 2 lines"}],"stream":true}'
```

### C) Python (OpenAI SDK)

`test_api.py` file use karein (step 6 dekhein).

---

## Step 6 — `test_api.py` (pehle se banaya hai)

```powershell
cd D:\GNW\perplexity-browser-api
uv run python test_api.py
```

Isse aapke local server par ek test query bhejega aur jawab print karega. Pehle `test_api.py` mein apna token ya `.env` load confirm kar lein.

---

## Follow-up queries (context) kaise rakhein

Library automatically `previous_response_id` ke through conversation thread manage karti hai (OpenAI Responses API style). OpenAI SDK se `previous_response_id` pass karke follow-up kar sakte hain.

---

## Troubleshooting

| Problem | Samadhan |
|---------|----------|
| `401 Unauthorized` | Token galat hai ya expire ho gaya. Naya token copy karein step 2 se. |
| `ModelAccessError` | Free account pe Pro model maang rahe hain. `model="perplexity/best"` ya free-tier model use karein. |
| `Cloudflare 403` / document upload fail | Perplexity ka attachment endpoint abhi Cloudflare se block ho sakta hai (known issue, Oct 2026). Sirf text chat try karein. |
| Server start nahi hota | Port 8000 pe kuch aur chal raha ho sakta hai. `--port 8001` try karein. |

---

## Sirf ek baar token nikaalne ka tareeqa (bina email ke)

Agar `token --email` command kaam nahi kar raha (magic-link/TOTP issues), toh browser se manual cookie copy karna sabse bharosemand tareeqa hai (step 2). Cookie roz 7 din baad ya forced revocation par change ho sakta hai — tab dobara copy karein.
